      "blocks": {
        "content_x4cVzW": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "Clinically Effective Dose",
            "the_text": "<p>Studies show that Ashwagandha is most effective in doses between 300 to 600 mg. </p><p>To deliver maximum results, each serving of Ashwagandha KSM-66 delivers a whooping 600 mg of Ashwagandha extract — right at the top end of the range. </p><p>Potency, backed by research — so you know you enjoy the full, unadulterated adaptogenic benefits of Ashwagandha. As nature intended.</p>"
