        },
        "content_ateTmC": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "Just 3 Ingredients",
            "the_text": "<p>KSM-66<em>®</em> Ashwagandha, organic rice fiber and organic pullulan capsule. That’s all.</p><p>Our ingredient list is shockingly short, but it’s by design. Because we want to keep Ashwagandha KSM-66 free of harmful additives, fillers, binders — basically, anything you don’t need.</p><p>An honest formulation with nothing to hide.</p>"
