          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "USDA-Certified Organic",
            "the_text": "<p>Our Ashwagandha KSM-66 is USDA-certified organic and Non-GMO</p><p>In other words, you can be confident that it’s free of toxins, pesticides, herbicides, and chemicals that can harm your body and the environment.</p><p>Speaking of protecting the environment, KSM-66<em>®</em> Ashwagandha is produced based on “Green Chemistry” principles, without alcohol or any other chemical solvents. This process took 14 years of R&D to develop and refine.</p>"
          }
        },
