            "the_title": "Third-Party Tested",
            "the_text": "<p>Ashwagandha KSM-66 leads the industry for quality, purity, safety, efficacy, and sustainability. </p><p>But you shouldn’t just take our word for it. </p><p>Every batch of Ashwagandha KSM-66 undergoes rigorous third-party lab testing — and because we believe in full transparency, we publish our lab results (i.e., Certificate of Analysis or CoA) on our website. <a href=\"/pages/impact-sustainability\" title=\"Impact & Sustainability\">Go ahead, check it out for yourself.</a></p>"
